    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When her evil brother takes over her temples in a ploy to rise to greater power, the Moon Goddess-- Vie-- enlists the help of a lowly town guardsman named Cut in order to take back her territory, stop her brother, and <strong>save the world.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><u><strong>Join Cut As He:</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> - Dies repeatedly to monsters twice (or even half) his size.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> - Builds a unique book of spells with the Goddess's divine power. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> - Deals with narcissistic, condescending deities guarding the stolen temples. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> - Upgrades his stats and spells while fighting towards the next boss!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> - Gets tired of dying repeatedly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> - Tries again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><u>Features Include:</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> - Deck-building your personal spell book. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> - Randomly generated maps and routes on each run, and the push to do it all over again when you fail. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> - <i>Breathtaking</i> pixel art.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> - An <i>original, <strong>adaptive</strong> soundtrack</i> consisting of tracks that change to fit the gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> - A story about saving the world, and yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  <strong>NOW WITH 50% FEWER SELF-INSERT CHARACTERS!!</strong></p>",
